# NOTE:
# This project uses Cloudinary for image uploads (gallery + logo).
# Firebase Storage is no longer used for media.
#
# Image uploads go through:
#   lib/cloudinary.ts  →  Cloudinary unsigned upload preset
#
# Configure in .env.local:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_CLOUDINARY_UPLOAD_PRESET
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_CLOUDINARY_FOLDER (optional)
